{"2498080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fruits of Fury", "steam_appid": 2498080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST CARPARK HERO</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight unending waves of fruit minions.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every minute, the buzzer rings and its time for a challenging new wave of enemies to appear and attack.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498080/extras/4c2fec82ac84ef23794076d1a468da0d.poster.avif?t=1770229871\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498080/extras/4c2fec82ac84ef23794076d1a468da0d.webm?t=1770229871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498080/extras/4c2fec82ac84ef23794076d1a468da0d.mp4?t=1770229871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the champions in the ring</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself for exhilarating showdowns with the personality infused fruit champion bosses which are brought to life through stellar voice acting. Each boss has their own set of unique mechanics, strengths and weaknesses.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498080/extras/8afe2ec293aaf7a526e93c17d783eb07.poster.avif?t=1770229871\" width=652 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498080/extras/8afe2ec293aaf7a526e93c17d783eb07.webm?t=1770229871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498080/extras/8afe2ec293aaf7a526e93c17d783eb07.mp4?t=1770229871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become stronger after each attempt</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn prize money and upgrade your abilities to the next level, with each level granting it a powerful new effect. Collect power up chests dropped from enemies during each run to further amplify your strength!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and acquire exclusive ring gear, featuring a wide array of modern pro wrestling attire, iconic Japanese outfits, and the most extravagant luchador costumes. Not only can you fight in style but the outfits provide powerful buffs to your skills, taking ability combinations to near infinite levels!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Up for a challenge?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete various challenges and earn rewards. Could you defeat a fruit boss without taking damage? Or complete a whole playthrough with only one ability active?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight unending waves of fruit minions.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every minute, the buzzer rings and its time for a challenging new wave of enemies to appear and attack.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498080/extras/4c2fec82ac84ef23794076d1a468da0d.poster.avif?t=1770229871\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498080/extras/4c2fec82ac84ef23794076d1a468da0d.webm?t=1770229871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498080/extras/4c2fec82ac84ef23794076d1a468da0d.mp4?t=1770229871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the champions in the ring</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself for exhilarating showdowns with the personality infused fruit champion bosses which are brought to life through stellar voice acting. Each boss has their own set of unique mechanics, strengths and weaknesses.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498080/extras/8afe2ec293aaf7a526e93c17d783eb07.poster.avif?t=1770229871\" width=652 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498080/extras/8afe2ec293aaf7a526e93c17d783eb07.webm?t=1770229871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498080/extras/8afe2ec293aaf7a526e93c17d783eb07.mp4?t=1770229871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become stronger after each attempt</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn prize money and upgrade your abilities to the next level, with each level granting it a powerful new effect. Collect power up chests dropped from enemies during each run to further amplify your strength!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and acquire exclusive ring gear, featuring a wide array of modern pro wrestling attire, iconic Japanese outfits, and the most extravagant luchador costumes. Not only can you fight in style but the outfits provide powerful buffs to your skills, taking ability combinations to near infinite levels!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Up for a challenge?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete various challenges and earn rewards. Could you defeat a fruit boss without taking damage? Or complete a whole playthrough with only one ability active?</p>", "short_description": "Lace up your boots! Fruits of Fury is a bullethell roguelike (bullet heaven) where you will decimate waves of fruit minions using an arsenal of unlockable and upgradeable skills. Then, step into the ring and face off against the champion fruit bosses as you journey from rookie to legend!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498080/header.jpg?t=1770229871", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498080/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770229871", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498080/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770229871", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.6Ghz or faster processor<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["BabyfaceJames"], "publishers": ["BabyfaceJames"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 399, "final": 399, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$3.